-        // If v1 = 0, |eps| is the absolute error between the actual value and
-        // |v1|.  Otherwise, |eps| is the relative error between the actual value and |v1|.
-        //
-        // The curve is
-        //
-        //   v(t) = v1 - (v1 - v0) * exp(-t/timeConstant)
-        //
-        // If v1 = 0,
